curring on railways are reported separately. With 2 357 reported cases in 2024, suicides outnumbered the victims accounted for by railway accidents. llected by the European Union Agency for Railwa s (ERA). ERA consistently releases data before Eurostat. It should be noted that there are no railways in the EU countri](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fec.europa.eu%2Feurostat%2Fstatistics%2Dexplained%2FSEPDF%2Fcache%2F94376.pdf&rut=bb9972f4a87d5cd7b26882d4d2b5824e7d8e31df11e684a085c65f666a351059)\\n\\n## [Railway safety statistics in the EU - Statistics Explained](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fec.europa.eu%2Feurostat%2Fstatistics%2Dexplained%2Findex.php%3Foldid%3D582055&rut=72a9a1e5fbb3c3401a6a58386e5986cbdcf4c6689aaea44030aeb3bb53b0ba91)\\n\\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fec.europa.eu%2Feurostat%2Fstatistics%2Dexplained%2Findex.php%3Foldid%3D582055&rut=72a9a1e5fbb3c3401a6a58386e5986cbdcf4c6689aaea44030aeb3bb53b0ba91\\n\\n [ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php?oldid=582055](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fec.europa.eu%2Feurostat%2Fstatistics%2Dexplained%2Findex.php%3Foldid%3D582055&rut=72a9a1e5fbb3c3401a6a58386e5986cbdcf4c6689aaea44030aeb3bb53b0ba91)\\n\\n [Suicides occurring on railways are reported separately. With 2 394 reported cases in 2022, suicides outnumbered the victims accounted for by railway accidents. Eurostat publishes data collected by the European Union Agency for Railways (ERA) in its free dissemination database. This information is also published by ERA.](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fec.europa.eu%2Feurostat%2Fstatistics%2Dexplained%2Findex.php%3Foldid%3D582055&rut=72a9a1e5fbb3c3401a6a58386e5986cbdcf4c6689aaea44030aeb3bb53b0ba91)\\n\\n## [PDF Assessment of the Impact of Rail Suicides on EU Railways](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.era.europa.eu%2Fsystem%2Ffiles%2F2022%2D10%2FReport%2520on%2520assessment%2520of%2520the%2520impact%2520of%2520rail%2520suicides%2520on%2520EU%2520railways.