ics%2Dexplained%2Findex.php%3Foldid%3D582055&rut=72a9a1e5fbb3c3401a6a58386e5986cbdcf4c6689aaea44030aeb3bb53b0ba91\n\n [ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php?oldid=582055](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fec.europa.eu%2Feurostat%2Fstatistics%2Dexplained%2Findex.php%3Foldid%3D582055&rut=72a9a1e5fbb3c3401a6a58386e5986cbdcf4c6689aaea44030aeb3bb53b0ba91)\n\n [Suicides occurring on railways are reported separately. With 2 394 reported cases in 2022, suicides outnumbered the victims accounted for by railway accidents. Eurostat publishes data collected by the European Union Agency for Railways (ERA) in its free dissemination database. This information is also published by ERA.](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fec.europa.eu%2Feurostat%2Fstatistics%2Dexplained%2Findex.php%3Foldid%3D582055&rut=72a9a1e5fbb3c3401a6a58386e5986cbdcf4c6689aaea44030aeb3bb53b0ba91)\n\n## [PDF Assessment of the Impact of Rail Suicides on EU Railways](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.era.europa.eu%2Fsystem%2Ffiles%2F2022%2D10%2FReport%2520on%2520assessment%2520of%2520the%2520impact%2520of%2520rail%2520suicides%2520on%2520EU%2520railways.pdf%3Ft%3D1739289711&rut=19d24b004204bf762532a0a1b53330c250a750698f6aef7d3248e5dad0b053b9)\n\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.era.europa.eu%2Fsystem%2Ffiles%2F2022%2D10%2FReport%2520on%2520assessment%2520of%2520the%2520impact%2520of%2520rail%2520suicides%2520on%2520EU%2520railways.pdf%3Ft%3D1739289711&rut=19d24b004204bf762532a0a1b53330c250a750698f6aef7d3248e5dad0b053b9\n\n [www.era.europa.eu/system/files/2022-10/Report on assessment of the impact of rail suicides on EU railways.pdf?t=1739289711](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.era.europa.eu%2Fsystem%2Ffiles%2F2022%2D10%2FReport%2520on%2520assessment%2520of%2520the%2520impact%2520of%2520rail%2520suicides%2520on%2520EU%2520railways.pdf%3Ft%3D1739289711&rut=19d24b004204bf762532a0a1b53330c250a750698f6aef7d3248e5dad0b053b9)\n\n [1 EXECUTIVE SUMMARY The objectives fo