t. It should be noted that there are no railways in the EU countri](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fec.europa.eu%2Feurostat%2Fstatistics%2Dexplained%2FSEPDF%2Fcache%2F94376.pdf&rut=bb9972f4a87d5cd7b26882d4d2b5824e7d8e31df11e684a085c65f666a351059)\\n\\n## [Behavioral and location-related antecedents of train suicides](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fonlinelibrary.wiley.com%2Fdoi%2F10.1111%2Fsltb.12941&rut=c5f9af4733734f9ce819f303151f7a839c314cfc14d2a7041b28c821b392f699)\\n\\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fonlinelibrary.wiley.com%2Fdoi%2F10.1111%2Fsltb.12941&rut=c5f9af4733734f9ce819f303151f7a839c314cfc14d2a7041b28c821b392f699\\n\\n [onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/sltb.12941](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fonlinelibrary.wiley.com%2Fdoi%2F10.1111%2Fsltb.12941&rut=c5f9af4733734f9ce819f303151f7a839c314cfc14d2a7041b28c821b392f699)\\n\\n [INTRODUCTION Prevalence of train suicide In the European Union, 2204 suicides by train occurred in 2020 (Eurostat, 2021). In Germany, approximately 678 (7.3%; Eisenbahn-Bundesamt, 2021) out of 9206 suicides were train suicides in the same year (Federal Health Service Germany/Gesundheitsberichterstattung des Bundes, 2021). For Germany, it has been estimated that each train engineer (driver) is ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fonlinelibrary.wiley.com%2Fdoi%2F10.1111%2Fsltb.12941&rut=c5f9af4733734f9ce819f303151f7a839c314cfc14d2a7041b28c821b392f699)\\n\\n## [Railway deaths in the EU fall in 2024 after years of fluctuating trends](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.globalrailwayreview.com%2Frailway%2Ddeaths%2Din%2Dthe%2Deu%2Dfall%2Din%2D2024%2Dafter%2Dyears%2Dof%2Dfluctuating%2Dtrends%2F383725.article&rut=0ef9e6d2e308580886c0bf679f14f099f5b4176689517dd72b43c2dfb3e2dd2d)\\n\\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.globalrailwayreview.com%2Frailway%2Ddeaths%2Din%2Dthe%2Deu%2Dfall%2Din%2D2024%2Dafter%2Dyears%2Dof%2Dfluctuating%2Dtrends%2F383725.article&rut=0ef9e6d2e308580886c0bf679f14f099f5b4176689517dd72b43c2dfb3e2dd2d\\n\\n [www.globalrailwayreview.com/railway-deaths-in-the-eu-fall-in-2024-after-years-of-fluctuating-trends/383725.article](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.globalrailwayreview.com%2Frailway%2Ddeaths%2Din%2Dthe%2Deu%2Dfall%2Din%2D2024%2Dafter%2Dyears%2Dof%2Dfluctuating%2Dtrends%2F383725.article&rut=0ef9e6d2e308580886c0bf679f14f099f5b4176689517dd72b43c2dfb3e2dd2d)\\n\\n     2025-12-17T00:00:00.0000000\\n\\n [Suicides on railway premises are reported separately and consistently outnumber accidental fatalities. In 2024, there were 2,357 suicides, down 9.6% from 2,608 in 2014. Germany recorded the highest number with 688, followed by France with 267 and the Netherlands with 186.](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.globalrailwayreview.com%2Frailway%2Ddeaths%2Din%2Dthe%2Deu%2Dfall%2Din%2D2024%2Dafter%2Dyears%2Dof%2Dfluctuating%2Dtrends%2F383725.article&rut=0ef9e6d2e308580886c0bf679f14f099f5b4176689517dd72b43c2dfb3e2dd2d)\\n\\n## [Stable time patterns of railway suicides in Germany: comparative ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fpmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov%2Farticles%2FPMC3933256%2F&rut=b21da622f7c72129c86fac31599201dad9b1125d725fe426892edada6d95dbac)\\n\\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fpmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov%2Farticles%2FPMC3933256%2F&rut=b21da622f7c72129c86fac31599201dad9b1125d725fe426892edada6d95dbac\\n\\n [pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3933256/](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fpmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov%2Farticles%2FPMC3933256%2F&rut=b21da622f7c72129c86fac31599201dad9b1125d725fe426892edada6d95dbac)\\n\\n [The majority of fatalities on the European Union (EU) railways are suicides, representing about 60% of all railway fatalities. The aim of this study was to compare time patterns of suicidal behaviour on railway tracks in Germany between two ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fpmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov%2Farticles%2FPMC3933256%2F&rut=b21da622f7c72129c86fac31599201dad9b1125d725fe426892edada6d95dbac)\\n\\n#