.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3933256/](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fpmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov%2Farticles%2FPMC3933256%2F&rut=b21da622f7c72129c86fac31599201dad9b1125d725fe426892edada6d95dbac)\n\n [The majority of fatalities on the European Union (EU) railways are suicides, representing about 60% of all railway fatalities. The aim of this study was to compare time patterns of suicidal behaviour on railway tracks in Germany between two ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fpmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov%2Farticles%2FPMC3933256%2F&rut=b21da622f7c72129c86fac31599201dad9b1125d725fe426892edada6d95dbac)\n\n## [Number of accidents - rail - eurostat - Suicides involving railways ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fckan.transport%2Ddata.org%2Fen_AU%2Fdataset%2Fnumber%2Dof%2Daccidents%2Drail%2Deurostat%2Fresource%2F68079f59%2Dc1a2%2D4ddd%2D80a2%2Ddbbe326956fc&rut=3ae269df09badb5d89b8c2d3958c818da785a742f67bbfdab2afee898e94eb9e)\n\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fckan.transport%2Ddata.org%2Fen_AU%2Fdataset%2Fnumber%2Dof%2Daccidents%2Drail%2Deurostat%2Fresource%2F68079f59%2Dc1a2%2D4ddd%2D80a2%2Ddbbe326956fc&rut=3ae269df09badb5d89b8c2d3958c818da785a742f67bbfdab2afee898e94eb9e\n\n [ckan.transport-data.org/en_AU/dataset/number-of-accidents-rail-eurostat/resource/68079f59-c1a2-4ddd-80a2-dbbe326956fc](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fckan.transport%2Ddata.org%2Fen_AU%2Fdataset%2Fnumber%2Dof%2Daccidents%2Drail%2Deurostat%2Fresource%2F68079f59%2Dc1a2%2D4ddd%2D80a2%2Ddbbe326956fc&rut=3ae269df09badb5d89b8c2d3958c818da785a742f67bbfdab2afee898e94eb9e)\n\n [Additional Information Field Value Data last updated 15 November 2024 Metadata last updated 15 November 2024 Created 15 November 2024 Format CSV License Creative ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fckan.transport%2Ddata.org%2Fen_AU%2Fdataset%2Fnumber%2Dof%2Daccidents%2Drail%2Deurostat%2Fresource%2F68079f59%2Dc1a2%2D4ddd%2D80a2%2Ddbbe326956fc&rut=3ae269df09badb5d89b8c2d3958c818da785a742f67bbfdab2afee898e94eb9e)\n\n## [EUROSTAT - European Union Statistical Office (via Public) / Rail ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Febs.publicnow.com%2Fview%2F4DD89D1BF5E95DE007A3B32053FA8E2FD963311B&rut=f47779883de25c717ae0c2fc76fadcafe08a5d86bdb5cfd9347063eabd999bb7)\n\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Febs.publicnow.com%2Fview%2F4DD89D1BF5E95DE007A3B32053FA8E2FD963311B&rut=f47779883de25c717ae0c2fc76fadcafe08a5d86bdb5cfd9347063eabd999bb7\n\n [ebs.publicnow.com/view/4DD89D1BF5E95DE007A3B32053FA8E2FD963311B](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Febs.publicnow.com%2Fview%2F4DD89D1BF5E95DE007A3B32053FA8E2FD963311B&rut=f47779883de25c717ae0c2fc76fadcafe08a5d86bdb5cfd9347063eabd999bb7)\n\n     2025-12-16T00:00:00.0000000\n\n [Suicides occurring on railway premises are reported separately from fatalities or injuries. The number of suicides on railways is constantly much higher than the number of fatalities despite the downward trend seen in the EU the past decade (2 357 in 2024 compared with 2 608 in 2014, -9.6%).](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Febs.publicnow.com%2Fview%2F4DD89D1BF5E95DE007A3B32053FA8E2FD963311B&rut=f47779883de25c717ae0c2fc76fadcafe08a5d86bdb5cfd9347063eabd999bb7)\n\n## [Suicide-Related Mortality Trends in Europe, 2012-2021 - MDPI](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.mdpi.com%2F1660%2D4601%2F22%2F6%2F890&rut=ed309c05cda5a4508a59a6cdf4e18a02a1d26c706ea9685ef91230891e43fc17)\n\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.mdpi.com%2F1660%2D4601%2F22%2F6%2F890&rut=ed309c05cda5a4508a59a6cdf4e18a02a1d26c706ea9685ef91230891e43fc17\n\n [www.mdpi.com/1660-4601/22/6/890](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.mdpi.com%2F1660%2D4601%2F22%2F6%2F890&rut=ed309c05cda5a4508a59a6cdf4e18a02a1d26c706ea9685ef91230891e43fc17)\n\n     2025-06-02T00:00:00.0000000\n\n [We assess the age- and sex-specific trends in suicide-related mortality in the European states (EU) between the years 2012 and 2021. Methods: We retrieved data on cause-specific deaths and population numbers by sex for European countries from the publicly available EUROSTAT mortality dataset for the years 2012-2021.](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.mdpi.com%2F1660%2D4601%2F22%2F6%2F890&rut=ed309c05cda5a4508a59a6cdf4e18a02a1d26c706ea9685ef91230891e43fc17)\n\n## [Europe: railway accident deaths, by country| Statista](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.statista.com%2Fstatistics%2F1192970%2Feurope%2Drailway%2Daccident%2Ddeaths%2F&rut=53e703fe541ba8a2af7b3811f7376ecf2d2f01b3a1a126bf266adcb3c415eb3d)\n\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.statista.com%2Fstatistics%2F1192970%2Feurope%2Drailway%2Daccident%2Ddeaths%2F&rut=53e703fe541ba8a2af7b3811f7376ecf2d2f01b3a1a126bf266adcb3c415eb3d\n\n [www.statista.com/statistics/1192970/europe-railway-accident-deaths/](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.statista.com%2Fstatistics%2F1192970%2Feurope%2Drailway%2Daccident%2Ddeaths%2F&rut=53e703fe541ba8a2af7b3811f7376ecf2d2f01b3a1a126bf266adcb3c415eb3d)\n\n     2026-02-12T00:00:00.0000000\n\n [Eurostat. (January 13, 2026). Fatalities in railway accidents in the European Union and other European countries in 2019 and 2024, by country [Graph]. In Statista. Retrieved April 09, 2026, from ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.statista.com%2Fstatistics%2F1192970%2Feurope%2Drailway%2Daccident%2Ddeaths%2F&rut=53e703fe541ba8a2af7b3811f7376ecf2d2f01b3a1a126bf266adcb3c415eb3d)\n\n## [Rail suicide - Wikipedia](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FRail_suicide&rut=352ecd484186a0a1670161de0bfe723e9d8154daf08a0d0d2147fb94cdfce85c)\n\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FRail_suicide&rut=352ecd484186a0a1670161de0bfe723e9d8154daf08a0d0d2147fb94cdfce85c\n\n [en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rail_suicide](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FRail_suicide&rut=352ecd484186a0a1670161de0bfe723e9d8154daf08a0d0d2147fb94cdfce85c)\n\n [Rail-specific means of prevention have included platform screen doors, which has been highly successful at reducing suicide on some urban mass transit systems, calming lights, and putting signs with suicide hotline numbers at sites likely to be used.](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FRail_suicide&rut=352ecd484186a0a1670161de0bfe723e9d8154daf08a0d0d2147fb94cdfce85c)\n\n## [Safety Statistics - International Railway Safety Council](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Finternational%2Drailway%2Dsafety%2Dcouncil.com%2Fsafety%2Dstatistics%2F&rut=c5d623df7d1203bb0a9afd28cd1ceb7072edb119cfd08c63ba21ab9c037434ff)\n\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Finternational%2Drailway%2Dsafety%2Dcouncil.com%2Fsafety%2Dstatistics%2F&rut=c5d623df7d1203bb0a9afd28cd1ceb7072edb119cfd08c63ba21ab9c037434ff\n\n [international-railway-safety-council.com/safety-statistics/](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Finternational%2Drailway%2Dsafety%2Dcouncil.com%2Fsafety%2Dstatistics%2F&rut=c5d623df7d1203bb0a9afd28cd1ceb7072edb119cfd08c63ba21ab9c037434ff)\n\n [The methods used to collect safety data can vary widely between railway administrations as can its quality, making comparisons on a global basis difficult. Work by the European Commission dating from 2019 suggested that the risk of death for a train passenger within the EU is around 0.09 fatalities per billion train kilometres, nearly one third that for bus and coach passengers and around 28 ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Finternational%2Drailway%2Dsafety%2Dcouncil.com%2Fsafety%2Dstatistics%2F&rut=c5d623df7d1203bb0a9afd28cd1ceb7072edb119cfd08c63ba21ab9c037434ff)\n\n [Feedback](//duckduckgo.com/feedback.html)\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"ffa07e4ac31e283c\">>>"}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1776001237743}}
